# Project Brief Rule

**Before making any code changes**, read `docs/PROJECT_BRIEF.md` and ensure your changes align with:

- User stories (view, create, edit/delete activities)
- Activity types and colors
- Interface design (background #eae9e3, DM Mono font, white calendar, FAB, panel behavior)
- UX flows (FAB, date click, panel, view filter)

Treat the project brief as the single source of truth. If a change conflicts with it, discuss with the user or update the brief first.
